div.note:
5216] Here too there are two versions of text, that in the margin and that in the regular MS column, however they seem to correspond to two different speeches, that of Ynide and that of her father's shade, so both are transcribed here. 
                    Rajna: bordera. Though the final consonant is partially cut off, it does not have the curve of the standard MS r.; 
                    Rajna: sy vero signore ne fina abordera
